<title>BRAZIL: Aracruz Celulose year net 79.37 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Aracruz Celulose year net 79.37 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian pulp and paper manufacturer Aracruz Celulose SA issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			    1996			  1995</p>
<p>    Net		    79.37 million		  356.43 million</p>
<p>    Net revs	    512.83 million		  851.16 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Aracruz President Luiz Kaufmann said the net profit fall was due to a drastic decline in international pulp prices during 1996.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro Newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
